20:T6e8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use this tool in an emergency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In a life-threatening emergency, call 112 or 108 first. Use this tool only to help find a nearby facility while help is on the way."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the list show which departments are available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It shows hospitals from map data. Call the hospital to confirm the department, doctor and bed availability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this medical advice?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. ContentVerse India does not give medical advice. For symptoms or treatment decisions, consult a qualified doctor."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why are some places missing from the results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The data comes from map sources that may not list every business, and small or new places can be missing. Try a larger radius or a nearby landmark as the search area."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do nearby results need location permission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Near me uses your browser GPS. City search uses geocoding instead — no GPS needed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Nearby Hospitals free on ContentVerse India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All India utility tools on ContentVerse India are free to use with no sign-up required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an official government website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. ContentVerse India is an independent platform. We use public datasets and open APIs. For official records, use government portals like Parivahan, GST, FoSCoS, or ECI."}}]}21:T813,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to use Nearby Hospitals","description":"In a medical emergency, minutes matter. This nearby hospitals tool lists hospitals around your location or any area in India with their addresses and map links, so you can find the closest option quickly. It is a reference for planning and finding facilities; it does not replace emergency services. ","url":"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hospitals","totalTime":"PT5M","tool":{"@type":"HowToTool","name":"Nearby Hospitals"},"step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"How to find hospitals near you","text":"Use your current location or type the area, pick a radius and search. The list shows hospitals nearby with their address. Open the map link to see the distance and route and call the hospital to confirm that the department you need is available."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"What to do in an emergency","text":"For a serious emergency such as chest pain, severe bleeding, breathing difficulty, stroke symptoms or a road accident, call 112 or 108 immediately. Do not wait to search for a hospital while the patient’s condition worsens. If an ambulance is not available quickly, take the patient to the nearest hospital with an emergency department."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Choosing the right hospital","text":"A nearby clinic is suitable for minor problems, while a hospital with an emergency department, ICU and the relevant specialists is needed for serious ones. Government hospitals and many private hospitals empanelled under schemes like Ayushman Bharat can offer cashless treatment for eligible patients; confirm eligibility with the hospital’s help desk."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Location, privacy and accuracy","text":"The tool asks for your location only when you press the “use my location” option, and your browser shows its own permission prompt. If you prefer not to share GPS, type an area or city instead; the search then uses geocoding and needs no permission."}]}16:[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Nearby Hospitals\",\"alternateName\":\"Nearby Hospitals Finder India\",\"description\":\"Locate hospitals and clinics near your location or city for emergencies and care.\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hospitals\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ContentVerse India\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-IN\",\"featureList\":\"How to find hospitals near you, What to do in an emergency, Choosing the right hospital, Location, privacy and accuracy\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$20"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"India Tools\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Nearby Hospitals\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hospitals\"}]}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}]],"$L22"]
